  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Indian House Crow is an alien invasive species was introduced in Zanzibar around 1890 mainly to feed on garbage in rubbish dumps as one of the strategies to clean towns. The main objective is to eradicate this population in mainland Tanzania</narrative>
